#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:9
msgid "Add a Physics Backend"
msgstr "添加物理后端"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:11
msgid ""
"This guide extends Isaac Lab with a new physics backend. Read :ref:`backend-"
"architecture` for the factory-dispatch and portable-interface design that "
"this extension implements."
msgstr ""
"本指南介绍如何为 Isaac Lab 扩展新的物理后端。请先阅读 :ref:`backend-architecture` "
"，了解此扩展所实现的工厂分发和通用接口设计。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:16
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "先决条件"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:18
msgid ""
"Before starting, identify the engine's lifecycle, native data ownership, and"
" the assets and sensors it can support. The backend must provide a "
":class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` implementation and follow the "
"module layout expected by "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase`."
msgstr ""
"开始前，先明确引擎的生命周期、原生数据归属，以及可支持的资产和传感器。后端必须提供 "
":class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsManager` 实现，并遵循 "
":class:`~isaaclab.utils.backend_utils.FactoryBase` 要求的模块布局。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:24
msgid "Create the backend package"
msgstr "创建后端包"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:26
msgid ""
"Create an extension package using the backend name in its package path. For "
"example, a backend named ``mybackend`` uses this layout:"
msgstr "创建扩展包，在包路径中使用后端名称。例如，名为 ``mybackend`` 的后端使用以下布局："

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:60
msgid "Implement the physics manager"
msgstr "实现物理管理器"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:62
msgid ""
"The manager must expose a :class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` so "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` can read the backend's body "
"transforms in the Warp-native format consumed by renderers and visualizers."
msgstr ""
"管理器必须提供 :class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataBackend` ，使 "
":class:`~isaaclab.scene_data.SceneDataProvider` 能以渲染器和可视化器使用的 Warp "
"原生格式，读取后端的刚体变换。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:130
msgid "Define the physics configuration"
msgstr "定义物理配置"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:132
msgid ""
"Define a :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsCfg` subclass that identifies the "
"manager class and holds backend-specific settings:"
msgstr "定义 :class:`~isaaclab.physics.PhysicsCfg` 子类，指定管理器类并保存后端特有设置："

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:148
msgid "Register the backend key"
msgstr "注册后端键"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:150
msgid ""
"``FactoryBase`` does not derive a new backend key from an arbitrary physics "
"manager class name. Add the manager prefix to the core selector in "
"``isaaclab.utils.backend_utils`` before factories can resolve assets and "
"sensors for the backend:"
msgstr ""
"``FactoryBase`` 不会根据任意物理管理器类名自动推导新的后端键。在工厂能够解析该后端的资产和传感器前，需将管理器前缀添加到 "
"``isaaclab.utils.backend_utils`` 中的核心选择器："

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:167
msgid ""
"The existing ``_get_package_name()`` convention maps the ``mybackend`` key "
"to the ``isaaclab_mybackend`` package used above. If the integration uses "
"another package name, add an explicit case to ``_get_package_name()`` as "
"well. ``FactoryBase.register()`` only caches the concrete class after this "
"key and package mapping has selected and imported the backend module; "
"calling it alone does not register a new physics-manager prefix."
msgstr ""
"现有 ``_get_package_name()`` 约定会将 ``mybackend`` 键映射到上述 ``isaaclab_mybackend`` "
"包。如果集成使用其他包名，还需在 ``_get_package_name()`` 中添加显式分支。只有键与包映射选定并导入后端模块后， "
"``FactoryBase.register()`` 才会缓存具体类；单独调用它不会注册新的物理管理器前缀。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:175
msgid "Implement assets and sensors"
msgstr "实现资产和传感器"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:177
msgid ""
"Each supported asset or sensor extends the matching base class in "
"``isaaclab``. The implementation class name must match the factory's "
"expected name. Use ``lazy_export()`` in package ``__init__.py`` files. Once "
"the core backend-key mapping is in place, the factory imports these modules "
"by package and module-path convention and caches their implementation "
"classes."
msgstr ""
"每个受支持的资产或传感器都继承 ``isaaclab`` 中对应的基类。实现类名必须与工厂期望的名称一致。在包的 ``__init__.py`` 中使用"
" ``lazy_export()`` 。核心后端键映射配置好后，工厂会按包名和模块路径约定导入模块，并缓存实现类。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:195
msgid "Validate backend discovery"
msgstr "验证后端发现机制"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:197
msgid ""
"``FactoryBase`` maps ``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` to "
"``isaaclab_mybackend.assets.articulation`` after the registered "
"``mybackend`` key is selected from the active physics manager. Verify the "
"configured discovery path with the following checklist:"
msgstr ""
"从当前物理管理器选择已注册的 ``mybackend`` 键后， ``FactoryBase`` 会将 "
"``isaaclab.assets.articulation`` 映射到 "
"``isaaclab_mybackend.assets.articulation`` 。请按以下步骤验证配置的发现路径："

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:202
msgid "Construct the backend configuration."
msgstr "构造后端配置。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:203
msgid "Initialize a minimal simulation with that configuration."
msgstr "使用该配置初始化最小仿真。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:204
msgid "Instantiate one asset supported by the backend."
msgstr "实例化一个后端支持的资产。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:205
msgid "Step the simulation once."
msgstr "推进一个仿真步。"

#: source/developer-tools/add_physics_backend.rst:206
msgid "Close the simulation cleanly."
msgstr "正常关闭仿真。"
